  "description": {
    "raw": "This spell functions like create undead, except that you can create more powerful and intelligent sorts of undead: shadows, wraiths, spectres, and devourers. The type or types of undead created is based on caster level, as shown below.\n\nCaster LevelUndead Created15th or lowerShadow16th-17thWraith18th-19thSpectre20th or higherDevourer",
